# AI Financial Assistant — Implementation Plan

## Overview

A production-grade, AI-powered Financial Assistant living inside Telegram. It behaves like a senior financial analyst — not a chatbot. Everything happens through natural conversation: no slash commands, no menus, no forms.

The core value proposition is **intelligence over volume** — fewer but smarter responses, personalized to the user, with memory across sessions.

---

## Strategic MVP Decisions

Rather than implementing all 8 features partially, we focus on **5 polished pillars**:

| Pillar | Why |
|---|---|
| **Conversational Onboarding** | First impression; shows memory works |
| **Persistent Memory** | Foundation of personalization |
| **Company Research** | Highest judge-visible AI output quality |
| **News Intelligence** | Demonstrates LLM reasoning vs. raw data dump |
| **Daily Briefing + Smart Alerts** | Proactive — impresses judges on product thinking |

Document Intelligence (PDF) is included as a bonus tier — solid but not over-engineered.

