## LangGraph Agent Workflow

```
User Message ──► Router Node
                    │
        ┌───────────┼───────────┬──────────────┐
        │           │           │              │
   Onboarding  Research     News Intel    Document
     Node        Node          Node        Node
        │           │           │              │
        └───────────┴───────────┴──────────────┘
                    │
              Memory Node (reads + writes)
                    │
              Response Node (formats output)
                    │
            ◄── Telegram Message
```

The **Router** classifies intent using the LLM — no rigid keyword matching. The agent uses tools and memory at each node.

