## Key Technical Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Agent framework | LangGraph | Stateful, inspectable agent graph |
| LLM | Gemini 2.5 Flash | Fast, cost-effective, long context |
| Embeddings | Gemini text-embedding-004 | Consistent with LLM provider |
| DB async | asyncpg + SQLAlchemy async | Non-blocking I/O throughout |
| Telegram mode | Webhook | Production-grade, not polling |
| News source | NewsAPI + yfinance | Free tier sufficient for MVP |
| Memory strategy | Hybrid: last-N turns + semantic search | Best recall without token bloat |
| PDF parsing | pdfplumber + chunking | Reliable, no external service |

