## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 — Foundation
- Project scaffolding (folders, config, logging)
- Database models + async connection
- FastAPI app + webhook endpoint
- Telegram bot setup

### Phase 2 — Agent Core
- LangGraph state + graph definition
- Router node (intent classification)
- Memory system (conversation + semantic)

### Phase 3 — Onboarding + Memory
- Conversational onboarding node
- User preference storage
- Memory read/write tools

### Phase 4 — Research + News
- Company research tool (yfinance + Gemini)
- News intelligence tool
- Research/news nodes

### Phase 5 — Briefing + Alerts
- Daily briefing service + scheduler
- Smart alert system (price moves, SEC filings)
- APScheduler setup

### Phase 6 — Document Intelligence
- PDF upload handling
- Chunking + embedding pipeline
- RAG query tool

### Phase 7 — Polish + Delivery
- Prompt engineering refinement
- Error handling hardening
- README, Dockerfile, docker-compose
- Architecture + sequence diagrams

